          "explanation": "Learn ten useful words for ordering food and drinks at a café. Listen to each British English model and repeat it.",
          "patterns": [
            {
              "label": "Polite requests",
              "pattern": "[Drink or food] + please · Thank you.",
              "examples": [
                "Water, please.",
                "A sandwich, please.",
                "Thank you!"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "tip": "Escucha, repite y fíjate en la frase completa. Usa el modelo para crear tu propia frase."
